ou\u2019re losing, there\u2019s always an opportunity to strike back and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.poster.avif?t=1754409949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.webm?t=1754409949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1896570/extras/2f91e2b5da063534163f1826c7ffae8c.mp4?t=1754409949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
